# Canonical test rhythm library (deliberately wrong): crates/song_text/src/rhythm_library.rs, test `mistakes_are_all_reported_and_nothing_loads`.
# A short bar in "Short" and a rhythm with no group. The loader must refuse it: both are reported.
rhythm "Short"
  group "Swing"
  meter 4/4
  | q q q e |
rhythm "No group"
  meter 4/4
  | w |
